# 4. Large Datasets & CSVs
# =========================
# Ignore downloaded Kaggle CSVs and locally generated ML matrices
# (Pushing these will bloat your repo and can trigger GitHub's file size limits)
analytics_engine/data/raw/*.csv
analytics_engine/data/processed/*.csv

# NOTE: If you manually update 'mastery_matrix.csv', 'power_ratings.csv', 
# and 'track_profiles.csv', you should TRACK the features folder.
# But if a script auto-generates them, uncomment the line below to ignore them too:
# analytics_engine/data/features/*.csv

